---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="Yeh Bro privacy policy — what we collect on yehbro.com, analytics, email, affiliate clicks, and your choices."
	canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
	<article class="prose-wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="muted"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2026-10-29</p>
		<p class="lede">
			Yeh Bro (“we”) respects your privacy. This page explains what we collect on yehbro.com, why,
			and how to contact us. Plain-language summary — not formal legal advice. Confirm processor and
			privacy-law fit before production scale.
		</p>

		<h2>Who we are</h2>
		<p>
			Yeh Bro is a fitness education site (yehbro.com).
			Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@yehbro.com">hello@yehbro.com</a> ·
			<a href="/contact">/contact</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p>Depending on what you use:</p>
		<table>
			<thead>
				<tr>
					<th>Type</th>
					<th>Examples</th>
					<th>Why</th>
				</tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Site basics</strong></td>
					<td>Pages visited, device/browser type, approximate region (via analytics)</td>
					<td>Understand what guides help; improve the site</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Email</strong></td>
					<td>Address + signup source if you join the list</td>
					<td>Send the beginner stack checklist / updates you asked for</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Contact</strong></td>
					<td>Name/email/message you submit</td>
					<td>Reply to you</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Affiliate clicks</strong></td>
					<td>That you clicked a <code>/go/</code> link (and merchant-site cookies)</td>
					<td>Attribute referrals under affiliate program rules</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td><strong>Host logs</strong></td>
					<td>Standard request logs from Cloudflare or our host</td>
					<td>Security and reliability</td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
		<p>
			We aim to minimise collection. We do <strong>not</strong> ask for health diagnoses, bloodwork,
			or cycle logs as a condition of using the site.
		</p>

		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We prefer privacy-friendly analytics (e.g. Plausible or Cloudflare Web Analytics) that avoids
			invasive profiling where practical. If we later add tools such as GA4 or advertising pixels
			(Meta, TikTok), we will update this page and use consent where required before non-essential
			cookies/pixels fire.
		</p>

		<h2>Email &amp; processors</h2>
		<p>
			If you join our list, your email is stored by our email provider (e.g. Beehiiv / ConvertKit).
			That provider may process data on servers outside Australia. We use it only to send the content
			you signed up for and related Yeh Bro updates. Unsubscribe anytime via the link in each email.
		</p>

		<h2>What we don’t do (MVP)</h2>
		<p>
			No account system. No shop checkout on this domain. No Meta/TikTok pixels until paid ads are
			scheduled — and then only with appropriate consent and an updated privacy notice.
		</p>

		<h2>Affiliate networks &amp; merchants</h2>
		<p>
			When you follow an affiliate link, the merchant and/or network (e.g. Amazon Associates, Awin,
			Commission Factory, Impact) may set their own cookies and process purchase data under
			<strong>their</strong> policies. We do not control those third-party pages.
		</p>

		<h2>Overseas disclosure</h2>
		<p>
			Some processors (hosting, email, analytics, affiliate networks) may be located outside
			Australia (for example the US or EU). By using the site or signing up, you understand that may
			occur. We choose common vendors used by similar publishers; ask us if you need current processor
			names.
		</p>

		<h2>Security &amp; retention</h2>
		<p>
			We take reasonable steps to protect information we hold. Email and message data are kept only as
			long as needed for the purpose you provided it (or as required by law), then deleted or
			de-identified where practical.
		</p>

		<h2>Your choices</h2>
		<p>You can:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Unsubscribe from email anytime</li>
			<li>Request access to, or correction of, personal information we hold about you</li>
			<li>Ask questions about this policy</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			Contact <a href="mailto:hello@yehbro.com">hello@yehbro.com</a>. If you are not satisfied
			with our response, you may contact the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC)
			— see <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au">oaic.gov.au</a> for current options.
		</p>

		<h2>Children</h2>
		<p>
			Yeh Bro content is aimed at adults interested in gym training and sports nutrition. We do not
			knowingly collect personal information from children.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>
			We may update this page as the site grows (shop, pixels, new tools). The “Last updated” date will
			change; material changes will be reflected here.
		</p>

		<h2>Not medical advice</h2>
		<p>
			Site content remains general training / sports-nutrition information — see
			<a href="/disclosure">/disclosure</a>.
		</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
	}
	th,
	td {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.12);
		padding: 0.65rem 0.4rem;
		text-align: left;
		vertical-align: top;
	}
	th {
		color: var(--yb-lime);
	}
</style>
